/target/
# tauri-build writes its capability schemas here on every build (for the
# Tauri CLI, which this shell does not use).
/gen/
# tauri-build generates the five commands' allow-/deny- permission files here
# from build.rs's AppManifest list on every build (SG-000119 A3);
# tests/acl.rs asserts their content.
/permissions/autogenerated/
